{
  "title": "Vibrant Tunisian Chicken Stir fry",
  "description": "A citrusy and molten solo dinner dish featuring sweetened condensed milk in a stir fry, wrapped in a lotus leaf wrap, this Tunisian recipe is low calorie friendly.",
  "cuisine": "Tunisian",
